# Make the editor prefer export templates bundled next to the executable
# (AppImage: $APPDIR/share/godot/export_templates), so exported games use the
# patched templates shipped in the AppImage instead of the official SSE4.2-only
# ones. Falls back to the user data dir for platforms the AppImage does not
# ship templates for.
